  "summary": "Unveiling the Value of Motion for Cinematic Camera Trajectories and PartiCam: Camera-Controlled Video Generation with Reward Guidance",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "arXiv AI reports on narrative-driven LLM behavior, while arXiv Computer Vision presents agentic video generation frameworks. Both studies focus on enhancing video creation through coordinated multi-agent collaboration.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "CoRe introduces a co-evolving reward framework to address latent reward hacking in video diffusion models by dynamically refitting the reward model on the generator's current samples, ensuring the generator cannot gain reward by drifting away from real video preferences.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "PartiCam introduces a training-free Particle filtering method for improved camera-controlled video generation, enabling accurate and consistent camera control during video generation.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
